    </chairmanImage>
    <chairmanQuote>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[When I founded Centro, my vision was to build a company that goes beyond traditional outsourcing—one that truly understands and enhances the customer experience. Today, our expertise in BPO, digital transformation, and the healthcare industry allows us to help businesses operate more efficiently and create lasting customer relationships. Our success is driven by a team that shares this passion for innovation and excellence, and I couldn’t be prouder of what we’ve built together.]]></Value>
    </chairmanQuote>
